Nina and I eat dinner together.
We sit at the little table.
It is my first dinner in the flat.
The food is good.
We talk a lot.
Afterwards I make coffee.
It is the new coffee from the shop.
We walk over to the sofa.
Now we sit on the sofa.
There are two cups on the table.
The coffee is very warm.
"Welcome home," says Nina.
"Thank you," I say and smile.
We drink our coffee together.
The flat is lovely and warm.
A good dinner and a good friend.
I am very happy.
